Comment: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:09.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Opening Talk ===
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:09.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Good evening! I'm Tomomi Jiena Sumi,\Nthe voice of An Shiraishi from Vivid BAD SQUAD!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.88,0:00:14.57,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Good evening. I'm Kent Ito,\Nthe voice of Toya Aoyagi from Vivid BAD SQUAD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:20.55,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,SekaRaji is a radio program brought to you by the cast of Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:23.72,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hatsune Miku. We'll be your hosts for this episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:26.86,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yes! Well, here we are. We're finally doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.43,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We are, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.43,0:00:34.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wonder how long it's been?\NI always lose track of when we last worked together in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:35.15,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:36.28,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wonder when it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:39.71,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It feels like we do it often,\Nbut it also feels like it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.71,0:00:40.96,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:41.72,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't remember a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.98,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Not a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:47.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Actually, completely unrelated to work,\Nwe ran into each other on the train once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:50.14,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I was so surprised when we passed each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:50.07,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.07,0:00:53.78,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was shocked. since it was so sudden and random,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:55.56,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I just blurted out a greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:59.26,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Then I immediately regretted it,\Nlike, "Oh, sorry for bothering you."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.26,0:01:01.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, no, no. We were right near the doors,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:05.17,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,so it was just a quick "Oh!" and then you were gone like the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:04.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.17,0:01:10.64,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And we were both probably riding\Nwith colleagues or people from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:09.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:11.75,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mhm, mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:13.17,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, so I felt even worse about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:16.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm sorry too. But I was actually happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:18.56,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, because I got asked about it later on LINE.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:20.47,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,They were like, "Who was that?" and I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.47,0:01:23.52,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"That was Jiena-san." "Oh, okay." Neither of our companions realized
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:24.33,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,who the other was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:30.02,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,On my end, I was like,\N"Uh, well... that's someone I work with in the same unit."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:34.08,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. It's confusing for the people we're with,\Nso I felt bad about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:35.52,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So that happened, but...
Comment: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that definitely happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:38.18,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yep, it's been since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.18,0:01:39.27,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:39.64,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.27,0:01:40.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:41.24,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,What are we even talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:42.98,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, winter is in full swing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.05,0:01:44.53,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is. It's gotten so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:45.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Have you turned on your heater yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.05,0:01:46.03,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got it on all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:48.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, mine is definitely on too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.11,0:01:48.93,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.93,0:01:52.43,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I mean, last night I accidentally fell asleep without it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.55,0:01:53.18,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:54.62,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And it was freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:55.86,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I bet it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.86,0:01:57.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I woke up in the middle of the night like, "So cold!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:02:01.65,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've gotta get the blankets out and make sure you don't catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:08.04,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. At my place,\Nmy bed is just covered in pillows and blankets...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.78,0:02:07.32,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:11.34,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's kind of a mess, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.34,0:02:12.78,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:20.48,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,They aren't neatly laid out or anything. I have several pillows,\Nand I just pick which one to use based on my mood that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:23.95,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,What?! That sounds like a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.61,0:02:22.84,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.95,0:02:24.74,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'll decide,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.74,0:02:30.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"Today I want this pillow for my head," and then I'll just grab another one nearby to hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:33.72,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's how I sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:34.22,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:35.83,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And around my stomach,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:42.38,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I've got winter duvets and towels just scattered all\Nover the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:36.45,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Comment: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.42,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.42,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.38,0:02:42.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:47.14,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So, I choose what to use based on how I feel that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:47.32,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:52.07,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,but yesterday, I was sleeping normally when I got cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:55.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,so I had to redo my setup with another blanket.\NThat's how my day went.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:55.87,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:58.93,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's tricky, because it's still warm during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:03.74,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, and it's still a bit too hot to go out in a coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:04.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:05.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you walk a bit during the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:09.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,you end up dripping with sweat\Non the train and wondering what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:10.12,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:11.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Days like that have been continuing lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,They really have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:13.77,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Jiena-san, do you get hot easily?\NOr are you sensitive to the cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.78,0:03:16.09,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm very sensitive to the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:16.37,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:18.79,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So I'm already wearing my Heattech and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:19.56,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's early!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:20.07,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.56,0:03:20.75,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're opposites.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.35,0:03:22.28,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.04,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're total opposites.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.55,0:03:25.49,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We might not be able to see eye to eye on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:29.13,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,See, I actually really love the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:31.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really? You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:32.56,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I love it. I'm good with it and I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.34,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Comment: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:33.83,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:33.83,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:35.92,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,To be honest, I don't even own any thermal underwear,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:37.86,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.39,0:03:39.46,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and I probably never use those disposable heat packs either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:42.38,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. That must be nice, in its own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:45.47,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It is. It's nice, but on the flip side, I absolutely hate summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:47.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, because you end up dripping with sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:53.44,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. I mean, in winter you can just layer up,\Nbut in summer, even if you're down to nothing, it's still hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.54,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It's hot. It might even feel hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:58.59,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right. And you're constantly sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:03:59.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.25,0:04:03.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,When I sweat,\NI start feeling really bad for the people around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:04.05,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:05.37,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like when you're walking through the city...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:05.59,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:07.69,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's unpleasant, isn't it? Other people's sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:09.06,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:09.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Especially if you're about to brush against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.63,0:04:10.87,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you definitely worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:14.95,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. I feel like I'm constantly thinking "Oh, sorry" much more often in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:15.15,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:19.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, speaking of the season,\Nit seems it's already final exam time for students.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:17.34,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.69,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:22.96,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So fast. Good luck, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:26.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Thinking back,\Nhaving a test every month and a half is just awful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:28.62,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ugh, it really is. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:29.87,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I don't know how we did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:30.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:32.48,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You never really get a break, do you?
Comment: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.33,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.33,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true. Finals are really important, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:38.36,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're working hard.\NIt's the end of the second term, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:37.29,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.45,0:04:41.06,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see, it's already that time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:42.27,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.27,0:04:45.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Depending on the person, like for those taking entrance exams,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:48.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,students in their third year of middle or high school...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:47.88,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:51.64,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,They probably feel like they're almost free\Nfrom school exams, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:53.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:54.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, depending on the person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:55.64,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:05:02.29,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,University students too. For those\Nin their second or fourth year who've already landed a job,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:02.98,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:05.76,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,you should definitely make sure to have fun\Nduring the third term.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.35,0:05:08.12,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:12.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, that time in university is right\Nbefore you enter the workforce,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:09.64,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:13.63,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.69,0:05:16.42,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,so it might be the most free few months of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:17.39,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:17.86,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.39,0:05:19.24,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,You should have fun while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.43,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:21.72,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:22.23,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.23,0:05:25.37,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. I hope you all have a winter like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:25.83,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:27.63,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,And with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:31.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I ended up talking from the perspective of an old man.
Comment: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:35.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:35.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So, with this old man and old lady here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:34.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:36.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wait, "old lady"? Hey, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:38.04,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, no, wait. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.84,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,If you're an old lady, then I'm an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:46.05,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, well then, let's start this SekaRaji\Nwith your favorite big brother and big sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:47.18,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'm honored, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:48.58,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.06,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.09,0:06:00.39,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,This program is brought to you by Project SEKAI Colorful Stage! feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:01.39,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hatsune Miku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:08.59,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Once again, I'm Tomomi Jiena Sumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:09.77,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And I'm Kent Ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:10.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Now then...
Comment: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:13.53,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Exchange Notebook ===
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:13.53,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,We have another question in the exchange notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.03,0:06:13.53,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:18.71,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from our previous guests,\NYui Ogura and Rina Honnizumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.81,0:06:19.47,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.15,0:06:22.44,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"What is something you want to do before the end of the year?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:24.27,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Ogura-san wants to redecorate her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:24.77,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:26.61,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,And Honnizumi-san wants to go to a hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:27.85,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah! That sounds lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.99,0:06:28.99,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.21,0:06:31.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Do you have anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.19,0:06:33.22,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, something I want to do before the end of the year?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:35.55,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I want to go to a hot spring too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:37.29,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I definitely want to go to a hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:40.78,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I mean, anytime is fine,\Nbut since it's before the end of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.78,0:06:44.67,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'd like to feel like I actually got it done.\NI always want to go, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:44.79,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:46.97,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I want to be able to look back and say I actually went.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:47.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:49.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,As for something I haven't done yet... what would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:51.18,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:52.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:53.48,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,For me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:54.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,it's wandering around town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.99,0:06:56.07,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wandering around town?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:57.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Just strolling through the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:58.65,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ahhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.05,0:07:00.45,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,The other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.81,0:07:00.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.45,0:07:01.69,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I went to Shinjuku.
Comment: 0,0:07:01.81,0:07:02.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.81,0:07:02.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:05.65,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's been a while. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:11.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,usually you don't use a station unless you have a specific reason to go there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:12.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:16.79,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I pass through Shinjuku Station a lot,\Nbut I don't actually go out into the city that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:17.67,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:18.67,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I just don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:19.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:23.65,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,At least for me. I might go for shopping,\Nbut even then, I'm heading straight for my destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:23.93,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:28.33,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,If I'm going to Isetan after getting off at Shinjuku,\NI usually just walk through the underground passages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:29.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:33.55,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's about a one-station walk\Nfrom Shinjuku Station to the Shinjuku Isetan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:33.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:34.55,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:38.59,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'm not getting off\Nwith the goal of enjoying the sights along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:39.45,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.59,0:07:42.07,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But I tried doing exactly that in Shinjuku the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:42.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.91,0:07:44.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:44.29,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.37,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I felt like Urashima Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.37,0:07:46.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:48.69,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was like, "Whoa, this shop changed!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:49.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:50.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Or, "There are more arcades now."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:52.07,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, I see, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.09,0:07:56.47,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So,\NI really felt the passage of time and how the world has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:08:01.43,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It was like, "Whoa, where are all the Japanese people?" It was\Nthat kind of situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:02.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah...
Comment: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:05.07,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:05.07,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But I thought that was interesting in its own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:09.52,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, game centers... You know,\Ngame centers have a lot of ProSeka merch these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:09.67,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:13.03,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But the Taito Station at the Shinjuku East Exit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:13.67,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:18.63,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I used to work there part-time. I've mentioned it\Nin a few other places, so I think it's fine to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:18.69,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:19.64,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But when I went there recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:21.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I saw they'd added another Taito Station Shinjuku East Exit store!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.87,0:08:23.83,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa! Really? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:23.35,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, when I went the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:27.77,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,There was another store right across from the one\Nwhere I used to work. I was like, "Seriously?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:29.07,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.19,0:08:31.95,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So I felt a little happy about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.95,0:08:35.73,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and while I was watching the crane games getting all lively,\NI decided to play some myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:36.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you did? Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:39.63,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was kind of studying how crane games work these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.15,0:08:41.53,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and I actually managed to win a few prizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:42.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:44.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I enjoyed myself just like Toya would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:46.39,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:49.35,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Then I went home.\NIt made me realize I should really do that once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.41,0:08:50.71,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:52.85,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So next time, I want to try playing at a different station.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:53.75,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.91,0:08:55.57,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:59.09,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.\NIt's great to be able to spend your own time relaxing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:08:59.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And Jiena-san, you said the hot springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:02.33,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd love to go to a hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:04.89,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Where would you want to go? Any specific area?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:07.64,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I'd prefer somewhere close to Tokyo.
Comment: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:10.62,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:10.62,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'd like somewhere I can just pop over to for a day trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:11.95,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, a day trip, a day trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:13.74,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,When you think of day trips,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:17.47,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,maybe Shizuoka or Yamanashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:19.24,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, those sound about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:21.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Karuizawa is another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:23.43,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever been to Karuizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.22,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:27.68,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Actually, if you take the Shinkansen,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.68,0:09:28.46,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:28.45,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:31.17,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,it might be the fastest place to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:32.92,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:35.92,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, it takes exactly one hour from Tokyo to Karuizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.14,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:37.53,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:38.02,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Once the train starts moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:38.72,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:40.23,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So it's closer than you'd think, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:42.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, one hour is totally doable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:43.82,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I could definitely do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:44.75,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.75,0:09:46.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I highly recommend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:48.93,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Man, I really want to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:50.76,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:50.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A hot spring trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:52.27,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.94,0:09:53.46,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:52.95,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:56.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well then, even during the ending...
Comment: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:54.63,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:54.63,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:10:00.59,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, it is time for us to leave a message\Nin the exchange notebook for the next pair of hosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:01.62,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see...
Comment: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.66,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Listener Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.66,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,All right, let's read some listener mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:07.62,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,First, we have some general mail,\Nthough we've received themed messages as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:04.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:08.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:10.26,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Radio name: Neyachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:11.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Neyachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:14.02,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Hello, Jiena-san and Kent Ito-san! Kon-viva!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:14.86,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-viva!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Kon-viva!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:21.64,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The other day, while cleaning my room for the end of the year, I found some ProSeka merch I'd tucked away."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:21.86,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:26.73,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'm not much of a cleaner, but it wasn't just about getting things tidy; I made some unexpected discoveries, so I want to do it again."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:27.23,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:32.44,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Have either of you ever found anything nostalgic or unexpected while cleaning?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:36.42,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It's getting colder, so please take care of yourselves."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.42,0:10:37.64,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:38.33,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Finding something
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:40.88,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,that makes you feel nostalgic
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:42.07,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,while cleaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.07,0:10:43.06,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That happens, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:45.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:46.22,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,For me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:46.74,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,it definitely happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:48.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It does?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:48.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:51.07,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.62,0:10:51.12,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:53.19,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,merch that was tucked away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:53.42,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:55.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We tend to receive a lot of merch\Nfrom the projects we're in, right?
Comment: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:54.87,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:54.87,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.61,0:10:56.45,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:10:59.19,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And when I look at them occasionally...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:10:59.06,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.19,0:11:02.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It really brings back memories of the story scenarios.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:03.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:05.26,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like, if there's merchandise with stills or...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:05.58,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.26,0:11:09.88,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,...full-page illustrations,\Nit makes me think, "Oh, I remember this event."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:10.85,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.97,0:11:14.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. And even the characters' visuals...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:15.84,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,...have changed a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:17.93,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.69,0:11:19.16,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:20.95,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Since the beginning. Well, their school years changed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:21.53,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:23.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It makes me think, "Ah, they looked like this at the start."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:24.65,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It really brings it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:29.13,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,As for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:33.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't really like having too many things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:34.29,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:36.85,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm the type where this goes here, and that goes there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:37.53,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:41.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So once I've got everything arranged in its place,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:44.17,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't touch them at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:44.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You don't touch them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:46.29,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Even when I'm cleaning, how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.29,0:11:47.45,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Just that spot...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.65,0:11:47.48,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,The bare minimum.
Comment: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:49.48,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:49.48,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, just the bare essentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:52.02,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You don't have anything to pull out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:53.36,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:54.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:56.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder when I'll ever get to that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.35,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's so impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:03.08,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well then, out of everything left in your room,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:00.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:04.37,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.37,0:12:07.62,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,what's the oldest item, or the one most packed with memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:10.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't keep things just because they have memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:12.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wow! That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:13.77,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, no, haha, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.77,0:12:16.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I might not even have anything like that. It might not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:17.86,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It might not even exist...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:19.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,What's the thing I've had the longest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:20.28,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Maybe there really isn't anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.53,0:12:21.93,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I only have things like my clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:23.63,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A clock? Well, that's still good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:26.83,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's full of memories in its own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:29.03,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true. A clock I've used for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:30.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A clock for your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.97,0:12:31.56,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:32.83,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.03,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like the memory of when you bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:35.96,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like, "I bought this at that place."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:38.43,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:41.23,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Even the little things definitely count.
Comment: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:42.33,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:42.33,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:43.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.94,0:12:47.66,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wish I could live like that,\Nbut it's just not in the cards for me in this lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:48.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I could never do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:52.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,But I feel like a place with lots of things...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:56.27,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It sounds like a place filled with a lot of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.64,0:13:01.44,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wonder... honestly, there's plenty of stuff there\Nthat I don't even need anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:02.75,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:05.75,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like, "Why am I even keeping this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:06.73,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:08.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:11.93,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'll think,\N"Oh, I got this at an arcade two or three years ago..."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:12.54,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.80,0:13:17.37,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But then I realize it's actually from way longer ago than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:18.84,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'm just like, "Wait, really?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.47,0:13:19.67,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That happens, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:23.02,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll think I won something just last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:26.92,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,but when I look it up, it turns out it was three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:29.03,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,The fact that you're winning things so regularly is hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.03,0:13:33.59,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just end up doing it.\NThis is actually a Toya sync point for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.89,0:13:34.44,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.59,0:13:36.76,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,but when I see a new game or a new prize,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.76,0:13:40.93,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I get curious and just have to go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:42.72,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's great, it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:46.84,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's terrifying, really. Plus,\Nnow that I'm an adult, I'll keep going until I win it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:49.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, true. It's different from when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:51.62,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. Giving up halfway through is no longer an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:52.24,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.51,0:13:53.54,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's bad.
Comment: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:56.54,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:56.54,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,As a result, it becomes even harder to throw things away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:58.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, but it's important to cherish them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.13,0:14:00.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly. That's what I was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.13,0:14:00.63,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:01.13,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:05.53,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Next, we have a message from Radio name: Solly.\N"Jiena-san, Ito-san, good evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.53,0:14:06.03,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.25,0:14:09.73,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The other day, I finally got to try wanko soba, which I'd been wanting to do for a long time."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.81,0:14:10.65,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:14.47,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I've had this small dream of trying wanko soba since I was a kid,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.11,0:14:14.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:17.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"and I was finally able to make it happen in Morioka."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:17.93,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:21.94,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Once I started, the bowls of soba were served at a much faster pace than I imagined,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:22.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:25.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"and halfway through, it became a battle between deliciousness and pain."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.11,0:14:25.76,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:30.13,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"In the end, I managed to eat 160 bowls."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:31.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Whoa! Wait, isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:32.09,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.66,0:14:32.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:36.08,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I was just so happy to have fulfilled one of my childhood dreams."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:40.29,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Do you two have anything you've longed for since childhood or any dreams you've realized as adults?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:41.03,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they sent in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.03,0:14:41.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:44.84,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,160 is actually pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:48.86,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm pretty sure for wanko soba,\Nonce you pass 100, you're doing really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:50.07,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But 160!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:50.95,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:52.66,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wow, they must have really saved up their...
Comment: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:56.00,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:56.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So you've unleashed your inner desire for wanko soba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:57.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:15:00.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's even faster than you'd think.\NThey're literally standing right there waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:01.75,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:03.42,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're already on standby right next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.05,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow. Have you ever done it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:05.88,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:06.82,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,How many bowls did you get through?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:10.09,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I don't think I quite made it to 100, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:11.79,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.79,0:15:15.42,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, there are plenty of places right\Nin front of Morioka Station where you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:16.96,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh, that sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:17.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:18.37,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:21.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing. You start wondering\Nat what kind of crazy pace the shop is boiling the noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.51,0:15:23.56,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:25.08,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wait, have you never tried wanko soba?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:27.87,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Never. It sounds fun, though. I'd love to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:28.85,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:31.19,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, it really is a whole cultural experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.19,0:15:32.22,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It sounds like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:34.47,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Morioka is the place for it, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:35.18,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:36.35,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I want you to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:37.18,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:39.24,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So, as for things you want to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:39.86,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Or things I've always dreamed of?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:40.72,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Things you've dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:46.23,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, let's see. I actually still have something\NI've always dreamed of doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:46.89,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Comment: 0,0:15:46.89,0:15:49.12,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.89,0:15:49.12,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I want to get a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:52.86,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I've wanted a dog since I was a kid.\NI want to sleep together with one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.12,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, so you've never owned one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.17,0:15:57.38,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, I've never had one of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:16:01.38,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I see. So you've just helped look\Nafter a friend's dog or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:02.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, or my sister's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:03.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:05.77,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Or at my mom's family home, that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:06.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.61,0:16:08.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:10.17,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So it has to be a dog, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.97,0:16:12.37,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I want to get a dog and sleep together with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:15.42,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Not a cat or a bird? It specifically has to be a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.93,0:16:19.44,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I've never owned one myself either, but my relatives have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:20.03,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:26.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Apparently,\Nmy family had one for a very short time right after I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:27.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:31.44,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's about it. It shows up in old family photos\Nwhen I look back at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:32.08,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:34.07,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We had a beagle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:35.99,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,A beagle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:40.78,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But since it was there when I was born,\Nthere were dog-related things around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:41.22,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:48.06,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like a gate or a step on the floor.\NThere were traces that we used to have a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:49.56,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A dog, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:53.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Having a dog seems like it would really help fix your daily routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:54.86,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true, like waking up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:56.88,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Waking up properly\Nin the morning and coming home on time at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:59.36,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, and eating your meals at the right times too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:02.13,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A pet... Yeah, when you put it that way, a pet sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:04.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I hope to make that dream come true someday.
Comment: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:05.99,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:05.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I really admire that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:06.63,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.78,0:17:10.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,If I were to get a pet, a cat would probably be more my speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:11.66,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:14.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. So, my birthday was in October,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:19.42,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and even though I never said a word\Nabout liking cats or wanting to own one...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:20.27,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.67,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:29.62,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I received a cat encyclopedia and a book called "The Cat White Paper" as birthday presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:28.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:34.75,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got these books that cover everything\Nfrom how to raise them to all the different breeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.75,0:17:36.53,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was wondering why I got them, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:39.66,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was wondering why, but then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:39.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Why, indeed. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:40.87,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Then I realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:41.59,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:43.24,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I encountered a stray cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:43.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:46.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, I ran into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.61,0:17:47.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:49.07,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,This is a bit hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:50.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.35,0:17:52.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, at my parents' house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.41,0:17:53.15,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:59.68,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I mean, my parents' place is really close by,\Nbut it's just my mother living there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:57.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:17:59.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.68,0:18:06.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, we were talking about how a stray cat had shown up\Nat the house, right after I'd gotten those cat books.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:03.88,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:06.66,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:07.43,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.89,0:18:08.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh wow.
Comment: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:10.82,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:10.82,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So a stray cat left a little present in the yard and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:11.88,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.51,0:18:17.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Actually, it was the other way around.\NI found poop in the yard and realized a cat had been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:17.27,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:18.84,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:23.03,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And, well, it was one of those cats\Nwith a little notch in its ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:23.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:26.13,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So that means it's been properly... you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:33.23,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Neutered and is being looked after by the local government.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:28.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:32.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:33.53,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.23,0:18:34.68,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Since that cat showed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.49,0:18:35.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:40.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I felt like maybe it was a sign, or something like destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:40.95,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:44.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I haven't actually started taking care of it yet,\Nand I haven't even seen it since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:43.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.84,0:18:46.24,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:50.89,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. But I decided that if it happens again,\NI'm going to take it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:53.26,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:54.76,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I talked it over with my mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:55.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:58.14,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And I went ahead and bought some Churu treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:18:59.73,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So you're ready anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:01.06,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Just in case it comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.74,0:19:02.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So you can lure it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.14,0:19:04.28,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. So even though...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:04.57,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Even though you're all prepared.
Comment: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:09.08,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:09.08,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I definitely have that aspiration.\NI'd love to welcome them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:07.37,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:11.58,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I agree. It would be great if they showed up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:15.12,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Who knows? We'll have to see what fate has in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:15.82,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:16.83,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:17.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:19.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And that's all for this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:23.09,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're always looking for questions or topics you'd like to ask the ProSeka cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:19.64,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Comment: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:30.35,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song ===
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:30.35,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Now, it is time for a song.\NJiena-san, do you remember the song we are playing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.51,0:19:29.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.35,0:19:32.18,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:32.76,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:40.82,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It is just so emotional. It really hits home, like,\N"Toya has a lot of songs like this, doesn't he?" I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:35.17,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:38.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:47.63,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That is true. Lately, I have had this image\Nthat Toya gets a lot of "light" songs within VBS.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:42.18,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.44,0:19:49.79,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:50.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.81,0:19:56.52,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I feel like those songs\Nwith heavy beats or darker themes usually go to the other members
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:58.18,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,during their focus events.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:53.94,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.26,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:20:06.45,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So I realized that Toya hasn't really done many songs\Nwith heavy themes lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:02.59,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.15,0:20:04.72,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.19,0:20:07.47,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:10.96,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So in that sense, it is a very memorable song for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:11.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:16.89,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Alright, please have a listen. "Touka suru Ondo".
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.51,0:22:18.71,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,SekaRaji
Comment: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:25.62,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Theme Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:25.62,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We asked for listener mail based on this theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:31.08,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,"This is how we made up!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:34.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.30,0:22:35.03,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.21,0:22:39.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, we asked everyone to send\Nin stories of how they reconciled with family or friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.49,0:22:40.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.01,0:22:42.09,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well then, let's introduce some of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.09,0:22:43.54,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yes, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:45.95,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Radio name: Rera.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.95,0:22:46.48,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:47.46,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Kon-viva!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:48.03,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Kon-viva!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.12,0:22:50.03,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"This is the first time I'm sending in listener mail."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:50.49,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.49,0:22:51.34,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.34,0:22:55.32,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The other day, I had a fight with a friend I've known since kindergarten."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.32,0:22:56.15,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.15,0:23:01.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I wanted to make up, so I decided to try making them laugh with an inside joke."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:01.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.25,0:23:06.97,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"At first, they didn't laugh at all and things felt really awkward, but..."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:06.92,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.97,0:23:10.58,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I kept pushing and pushing, and they finally laughed!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.58,0:23:13.92,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"We both got the giggles and were able to talk like we usually do."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.92,0:23:19.86,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It took courage to speak up, but their presence in my life was so big that we made up!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.04,0:23:21.95,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Ah, that's so good. Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.71,0:23:22.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.95,0:23:23.32,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You didn't let your heart break.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.78,0:23:24.83,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,You just kept pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.94,0:23:25.96,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:27.79,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It sounds just like VBS.
Comment: 0,0:23:27.79,0:23:28.85,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.79,0:23:28.85,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:32.47,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It took a few steps, but it was like, "Please, just laugh!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.31,0:23:32.03,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.47,0:23:33.92,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"Reach them!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:34.95,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"Laugh!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.38,0:23:36.58,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:38.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A real power gag.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.00,0:23:38.86,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.70,0:23:42.73,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's nice. and I like how they realized their true feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.73,0:23:44.97,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,in the second half of the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.60,0:23:45.18,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.18,0:23:49.26,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,More than the courage it took,\Nthe presence of that friend was just bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.76,0:23:53.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right. If you just think, "Oh, it's no use," and give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.80,0:23:54.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.36,0:23:55.62,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,then it really is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.38,0:23:58.34,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It would've ended there.\NI'm a little curious about the gag itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.18,0:24:00.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Me too, I'm curious!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:23:59.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,What did they say...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.40,0:24:01.82,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wonder what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.56,0:24:05.18,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We might hear it and think, "Well, no wonder they didn't laugh."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:07.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,An inside joke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.68,0:24:13.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,An inside joke. But man,\Nmaking up after being friends since kindergarten...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.80,0:24:17.14,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wonder how many years they've been together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.22,0:24:17.98,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.02,0:24:21.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,If it's since kindergarten, you probably barely even remember
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.16,0:24:24.06,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,meeting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.58,0:24:23.22,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.06,0:24:28.32,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I remember things like,\N"Oh, this happened," or "We had a recital."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:31.78,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's impressive that they can still have fights like\Nthat after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.82,0:24:33.16,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Comment: 0,0:24:33.16,0:24:35.04,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.16,0:24:35.04,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So you guys still have disagreements sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.12,0:24:36.14,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.42,0:24:37.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.16,0:24:38.06,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.06,0:24:40.54,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's wonderful. Please cherish that spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.54,0:24:43.14,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, doesn't it make your bond even deeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.14,0:24:46.03,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Totally. You're basically best friends for life at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.03,0:24:47.14,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Cherish them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:48.08,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.20,0:24:51.36,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,Next, we have a letter from Radio name: I want to drink coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.36,0:24:53.56,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Jiena-san, Kent-san, kon-viva!"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.56,0:24:54.28,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-viva!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.70,0:24:54.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Kon-viva!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.60,0:24:56.96,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I always enjoy listening to the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.96,0:25:00.18,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I don't really fight with my friends often, but..."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.94,0:25:00.44,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.18,0:25:05.68,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"...whenever we do, we have an unwritten rule to give each other a Tirol Choco when we say sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.44,0:25:06.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Aww, that's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.68,0:25:07.24,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, how sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.24,0:25:12.24,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It's nice to receive one, and it's fun to think about which flavor to give them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.24,0:25:15.39,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Does VBS have any unwritten rules like that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.39,0:25:17.43,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,What a lovely story.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.43,0:25:19.96,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's great. It probably makes it easier
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.96,0:25:21.94,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,to find an opening to make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.66,0:25:22.56,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.94,0:25:27.63,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's nice. Even\Nwhen it's a little hard to be the first one to say "I'm sorry,"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.63,0:25:28.74,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,you can just hand them a chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.74,0:25:29.69,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.69,0:25:32.12,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It's nice to have a rule like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.12,0:25:32.66,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,For sure.
Comment: 0,0:25:33.22,0:25:34.26,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.22,0:25:34.26,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Does VBS have anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.26,0:25:35.54,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,A VBS rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.54,0:25:37.86,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Let's see... maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.86,0:25:40.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We all just do our own thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.52,0:25:42.04,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That really is the ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.86,0:25:43.44,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We don't interfere with each other too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.18,0:25:44.92,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's definitely the ideal way to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.62,0:25:46.66,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.66,0:25:47.38,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.38,0:25:47.88,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.90,0:25:53.36,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I feel like we've just naturally fallen into that rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.36,0:25:59.28,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, is it like how Akina-san and Imai-kun start filming TikToks whenever we're all together for an event?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.58,0:25:59.83,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.83,0:26:01.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,And we just watch them warmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.74,0:26:05.66,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's basically an unwritten rule now.\NNobody says anything, they just start doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.84,0:26:06.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.36,0:26:08.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,The two of us don't say a word about it, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.50,0:26:12.82,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. They're usually already practicing,\Nand we're just like, "What is it this time?"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.50,0:26:16.12,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, and even if we suddenly end up in the shot,\Nwe're just like, "Oh well."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.12,0:26:17.84,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're just like, "Wait, what are we doing today?"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.80,0:26:20.36,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's probably true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.36,0:26:22.82,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It might already be an unspoken agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.82,0:26:23.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.74,0:26:25.94,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not really a formal rule, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.88,0:26:29.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Still, I'm glad it's become a regular thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.50,0:26:32.22,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. They were filming again, weren't they?\NDid they film at the fan festa?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.64,0:26:35.46,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,They did! They filmed at the ProSeka Kanshasai\Nthat you couldn't make it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.46,0:26:37.02,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Man, seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.94,0:26:40.04,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I can't really say anything to that except "I'm so sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.06,0:26:43.58,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was hoping they'd do it, and they didn't disappoint.
Comment: 0,0:26:43.38,0:26:46.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.38,0:26:46.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, but there's also that. Even when some of us aren't there,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.41,0:26:48.58,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,we still end up in the group photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.62,0:26:49.12,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.17,0:26:49.75,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.12,0:26:51.59,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We do, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.98,0:26:53.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That might be a common thing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.27,0:26:55.58,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right, it probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.02,0:26:56.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. You sent one in for us, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.58,0:26:56.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.91,0:27:00.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was actually at a different event that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.00,0:27:02.06,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,but I made sure to change clothes after it ended...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.07,0:27:02.57,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.60,0:27:03.48,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,...and took a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.36,0:27:05.09,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.98,0:27:08.04,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, so for those of you who saw it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.04,0:27:10.62,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,that photo was actually brand new. I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.33,0:27:13.09,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I took it right after my event and sent it over,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.09,0:27:15.94,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and then I was edited into the group photo from the other event.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.08,0:27:20.64,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing how you sent a photo that blended in so perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.81,0:27:22.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, I took a ton of shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.60,0:27:25.14,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I figured if I sent enough,\None of them would have to look natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.14,0:27:25.97,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.26,0:27:28.88,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,After that, I just said, "I'll leave the rest to you."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.18,0:27:30.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Trusting their editing skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.97,0:27:31.04,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I had full faith in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.34,0:27:33.22,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that definitely feels like a VBS rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.22,0:27:36.14,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Even if someone isn't there, we're still together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.86,0:27:35.93,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.93,0:27:36.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.90,0:27:40.24,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And well, when it comes to that sort of thing, our leader...
Comment: 0,0:27:40.24,0:27:41.86,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.24,0:27:41.86,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's definitely Akina-san, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.78,0:27:42.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.89,0:27:45.37,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,She's like the camera boss on SNS and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.39,0:27:48.78,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True. If we're taking photos,\Nit has to be with Akina-san's camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.38,0:27:50.62,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Akina-san.\NWe just leave it to her and say, "Please!"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.56,0:27:50.06,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.99,0:27:53.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow, we actually came up with quite a few\Nwhen we thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.72,0:27:54.54,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,There are surprisingly many.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.54,0:27:56.38,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's how VBS is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.27,0:27:57.23,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.23,0:27:59.12,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Okay, let's move on to the next mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.77,0:27:59.27,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.27,0:28:03.16,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Radio name: Shio no Kyuri-zuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.92,0:28:03.65,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Sounds delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.87,0:28:05.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay, "Kon-viva!"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.60,0:28:06.37,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"Kon-viva."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.42,0:28:08.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"This is my first time sending in listener mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.81,0:28:09.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.34,0:28:12.48,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,When I get into a fight with a very close friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.48,0:28:14.29,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,we have set rules for fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.44,0:28:15.02,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.08,0:28:20.09,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,First, we both say whatever we want to each other.\NOnce we've said our piece, I'll say,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.09,0:28:21.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,'I want this specific thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.89,0:28:25.33,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,and if you apologize along with giving it to me,\NI'll forgive you. How about you?'
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.90,0:28:28.27,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Then they'll say, 'Well, I've been interested in this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.27,0:28:32.73,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,so if you give me that as an apology gift and say sorry,\Nwe're good.'
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.73,0:28:35.13,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,We tell each other what we want from a position of superiority,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.13,0:28:39.37,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,then exchange the items and apologize\Nat the same time on a later date to make up."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.35,0:28:40.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's actually great!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.85,0:28:43.02,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Comment: 0,0:28:43.36,0:28:44.41,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.36,0:28:44.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.60,0:28:46.03,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.72,0:28:49.17,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I think it's lovely, but everyone involved is being very mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.58,0:28:50.45,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.73,0:28:53.29,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's so peaceful. What a wonderful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.34,0:28:55.88,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,After all, even if you have a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.88,0:28:57.92,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,wanting to make up...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.92,0:29:01.63,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,is something\Nyou only do for someone who's truly important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.38,0:29:01.83,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.83,0:29:04.48,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wow, that's just... that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.06,0:29:05.75,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.27,0:29:08.36,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll try that if I ever get into a fight with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.36,0:29:12.08,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Though once you become an adult,\Nyou don't really get into fights anymore, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.82,0:29:11.67,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.08,0:29:14.02,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It never really reaches the level of a "fight," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.94,0:29:14.75,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.00,0:29:18.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You just feel like it's not a good idea to keep arguing past a certain point.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.58,0:29:19.46,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.56,0:29:22.65,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you just end up saying,\N"Right, I see," and leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.90,0:29:24.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.33,0:29:26.73,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Man, I wonder what they bought recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.07,0:29:30.28,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I know, right? That sounds so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.12,0:29:33.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Do you have any memories of fighting with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.05,0:29:35.73,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.73,0:29:38.34,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I might not have any...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.34,0:29:39.26,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,at least not in the last few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.54,0:29:40.58,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I asked, but I don't have any either.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.86,0:29:43.04,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't even know if you could call them "fights" anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.28,0:29:44.38,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.21,0:29:45.84,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I've had moments where things got tense, though.
Comment: 0,0:29:45.68,0:29:47.22,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.68,0:29:47.22,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.22,0:29:50.12,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Being an adult is the worst, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.12,0:29:55.74,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It feels wrong to just call it a fight\Nwhen it's coming from my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.62,0:29:56.36,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.53,0:30:00.08,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Even though it's just a disagreement between adults...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.09,0:30:01.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.58,0:30:03.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It doesn't quite feel like a "fight."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.29,0:30:03.99,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.28,0:30:09.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's how it is. If I look back at actual fights...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.77,0:30:14.38,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Let's see. Well, it's usually just about the wording in an email.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.93,0:30:14.43,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.43,0:30:18.92,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like, just being annoyed by how something was phrased.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.99,0:30:19.02,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.64,0:30:22.24,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Thinking, "Was there really no better way to say that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.71,0:30:20.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.26,0:30:23.05,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.06,0:30:27.96,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I think it's pretty common to feel that way,\Nor to have others feel that way about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.56,0:30:28.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.96,0:30:32.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But with SNS, or social media, or LINE...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.11,0:30:32.64,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.69,0:30:36.75,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I still have no idea what the "correct" way to write a message is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.78,0:30:39.46,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Text is so hard. It's really tough to get the tone across.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.94,0:30:38.63,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.59,0:30:41.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Work emails are difficult too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.41,0:30:42.22,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.23,0:30:44.59,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You're not really supposed to use emojis or anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.93,0:30:46.12,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.61,0:30:46.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,In a professional email.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.12,0:30:46.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.91,0:30:51.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I don't know if "Understood" is right,\Nor if "Got it" is okay... I just don't know.
Comment: 0,0:30:51.99,0:30:56.13,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.99,0:30:56.13,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like, should I say "Yoroshiku onegaishimasu" or "Yoroshiku onegai itashimasu"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.72,0:30:58.29,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I just lose track of which to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.31,0:31:01.66,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, and the more polite you try to be,\Nthe colder it can end up looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.67,0:31:03.67,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. You end up wondering what the right move is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.07,0:31:05.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.01,0:31:06.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It happens all the time, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.24,0:31:07.17,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.18,0:31:11.97,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. I feel like these little things will probably keep bothering me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.90,0:31:12.88,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.15,0:31:17.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But it was lovely hearing\Nabout everyone's ways of making up after a fight today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.08,0:31:16.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.75,0:31:19.75,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I hope you all keep those traditions close.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.10,0:31:22.72,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I think that's everything. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.49,0:31:27.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Oh, right. That's all for this segment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:24.54,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.39,0:31:29.57,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.22,0:31:30.65,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.53,0:31:33.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We got to share a lot of messages. We heard some great stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.70,0:31:39.67,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We really did. It made me think that if I ever get into a fight,\NI should try making a little rule for making up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.65,0:31:37.15,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.02,0:31:42.88,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Same here. Maybe I'll try it out with one of the VBS members.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.92,0:31:44.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.81,0:31:52.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes! This segment's theme was "How we made up." Thank you all for your submissions!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.56,0:31:46.08,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.72,0:32:06.94,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,SekaRaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.76,0:32:06.92,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,SekaRaji!
Comment: 0,0:32:20.38,0:32:23.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Ending ===
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.38,0:32:23.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We've reached the end of this episode of SekaRaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.91,0:32:26.98,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're always looking for submissions from all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.98,0:32:31.96,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,The address is sekairadio@pjsekai.jp.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.96,0:32:35.17,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Please check the official ProSeka X account for more details.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.17,0:32:38.77,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's better to send your mail in early, so please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.77,0:32:40.55,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And don't forget your Radio name!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.63,0:32:46.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,All right. Now, let's leave a comment\Nin the exchange notebook for the next pair of hosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.47,0:32:45.97,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.19,0:32:48.32,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Our comment will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.40,0:32:49.55,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,What should we go with?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.69,0:32:51.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.70,0:32:52.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.20,0:32:53.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,How about that one we talked about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.35,0:32:56.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, the one we were just saying would be good?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.83,0:32:56.33,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.33,0:32:57.62,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, is that okay? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.25,0:32:57.75,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.62,0:32:59.34,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.34,0:33:00.47,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.68,0:33:01.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ito-san, if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.27,0:33:01.87,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.87,0:33:03.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, since it's December...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.36,0:33:03.86,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.86,0:33:05.93,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,The kanji for December literally means "the master runs," so...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.55,0:33:06.05,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.05,0:33:07.88,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"When was the last time you ran?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.88,0:33:09.02,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"And why?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.20,0:33:09.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.90,0:33:10.57,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.69,0:33:11.68,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I want to hear the answer to that.
Comment: 0,0:33:11.68,0:33:16.05,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.68,0:33:16.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, you know, as you become an adult,\Nyou don't really get many chances to run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.15,0:33:16.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.94,0:33:19.68,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So, it could be about running for exercise,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.31,0:33:19.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.81,0:33:21.98,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,or even just running because you're running late for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.05,0:33:22.55,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.55,0:33:25.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'd love to hear some stories from you two about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.61,0:33:25.38,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.38,0:33:26.53,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting for your mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.53,0:33:29.62,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.55,0:33:29.57,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.62,0:33:33.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,And just like that, we're already nearing the end of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.25,0:33:37.35,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's over already. Today was really nice, though.\NMy heart feels so warm now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.21,0:33:38.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I know, it was a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.89,0:33:41.76,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're actually recording this in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.38,0:33:41.88,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.88,0:33:44.48,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,but I feel like I'll be able to spend the rest of the day feeling warm and fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.48,0:33:45.67,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I think so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.67,0:33:46.95,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.95,0:33:48.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.52,0:33:51.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,And with that, it's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.06,0:33:51.79,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.89,0:33:53.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I've been Tomomi Jiena Sumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.97,0:33:55.38,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and I've been Kent Ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.96,0:34:09.03,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,This program was brought to you by Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.03,0:34:09.97,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Hatsune Miku.
